# Wrangler local dev authentication (optional)
# Copy to .dev.vars — this file is for the Wrangler CLI only, NOT the React app.
#
# Option A (recommended): run `wrangler login` instead of using a token here.
#
# Option B: uncomment and add your Cloudflare API token so Workers AI works in local dev.
# The token needs "Workers AI" and "Account" read permissions.
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
